    "body": "### Is your feature request related to a problem? Please describe.\nWhen writing custom Axios interceptors or custom adapters, developers frequently need to resolve whether a URL is absolute or manually combine a base URL with a relative path. Currently, we have to either duplicate the logic from `lib/helpers/isAbsoluteURL.js` and `lib/helpers/combineURLs.js` or rely on internal undocumented paths.\n\n### Describe the solution you'd like\nExpose these two utility functions on the main `axios` object, perhaps under `axios.utils` or `axios.helpers`, alongside existing public methods. \n\n### Describe alternatives you've considered\nThe alternative is copying the functions into userland code, which can lead to divergent behavior.\n\n---\n**Note:** If the maintainers are open to this, I would be happy to submit a PR to implement it! Let me know if I should take this.",
